o what is missing from the  other companies out there and a hole  that you could potentially fill with  your product or services so hopefully  that helped good luck on the launch of  the business it's an exciting and  terrifying time I'm sure for you for  those of you watching if you liked the  video please give it a thumbs up below  it makes one of the more these videos  for you and if you have a question about  this video or question about your own  company feel free to leave it in the  comments below I always read those and I  try to respond to as many as I can so  thank you and we'll see you on the next  episode  I  you
 

